abstract: "An ecosystem-wide measurement study of the public Model Context Protocol (MCP) registry: a registry-grounded crawl and GitHub enrichment of 16,763 tool descriptions, heuristic detector outputs, a stratified human-validation sample, instance-level adjudication, and live ASR/refusal experiments, with scripts that re-derive every quoted number. Detector outputs are candidates rather than verdicts; reported precision is sample-scoped. Pre-paper snapshot v1.0.0."
